      "content": "It sounds like you are carrying a heavy weight of grief that leaves you feeling detached from your own reality. This sense of disappearing along with everything you shared is a common, yet intensely painful, symptom of profound loss. It might help to acknowledge that while the physical space might still be empty, the memories you hold inside can eventually become a source of grounding rather than emptiness. Please be gentle with yourself as you navigate through this period.",
